{"id":"n73893-4-10","stage":4,"title":"자산 · 资产","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73893-4-10-1","ko":"드디어 우리 프로젝트가 성공리에 끝났어.","zh":"我们的项目终于成功结束了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"프로젝트가","meaning":"项目，工程","explanation":"프로젝트：项目，工程；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"프로젝트","audio":"/audio/f05481bea1ddf15be9c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84499","senseId":"1","lemma":"프로젝트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성공리에","meaning":"成功(地)，圆满(地)","explanation":"성공리：成功(地)，圆满(地)；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"성공리","audio":"/audio/dadacfba9f47e305a4fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90300","senseId":"1","lemma":"성공리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났어.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f05481bea1ddf15b","term":"프로젝트","zh":"项目，工程","audio":"/audio/f05481bea1ddf15be9c4.mp3","entryId":"84499","definition":"研究或事业；或指该计划。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"